Good Will Hunting is a drama film directed by Gus Van Sant.

3
00:20:03,157 --> 00:20:09,157
Will Hunting is a headstrong, working-class genius
who is failing the lessons of life.

4
00:26:44,210 --> 00:26:50,210
After one too many run-ins with the law, Will's last chance is a
psychology professor, who might be the only man who can reach him.

5
