Will Hunting, played by Matt Damon.

6
00:40:06,315 --> 00:40:12,315
Sean Maguire, played by Robin Williams.

7
00:46:47,368 --> 00:46:53,368
Chuckie Sullivan, played by Ben Affleck.

8
