10
01:06:50,526 --> 01:06:56,526
Morgan O'Mally, played by Casey Affleck.

11
01:13:31,578 --> 01:13:37,578
Good Will Hunting is a 1997 American drama film directed by Gus
Van Sant and written by Ben Affleck and Matt Damon.

12
01:20:12,631 --> 01:20:18,631
It stars Robin Williams, Damon, Affleck, Stellan Skarsgård and Minnie Driver.

13
01:26:53,684 --> 01:26:59,684
The film tells the story of janitor Will Hunting, whose
mathematical genius is discovered by a professor at MIT.

14
01:33:34,736 --> 01:33:40,736
The film received acclaim from critics and grossed over $225 million
during its theatrical run against a $10 million budget.

15
01:40:15,789 --> 01:40:21,789
At the 70th Academy Awards, it received nominations in nine categories, including Best Picture and Best Director, and
won in two: Best Supporting Actor for Williams and Best Original Screenplay for Affleck and Damon.

16
01:46:56,842 --> 01:47:02,842
In 2014, it was ranked at number 53 in The Hollywood
Reporter's "100 Favorite Films" list.

17
01:53:37,894 --> 01:53:43,894
The film explores themes of boston, massachusetts,
mathematics, genius, male friendship, flashback.

18
02:00:18,947 --> 02:00:24,947
The tone is emotional.
